#: ../../tools/ebird_taxonomy_tools.rst:32 377343cd9b1b4c7a97328dfdea8fb8b6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the list of bird taxonomic groups from eBird "
"(Cornell Lab of Ornithology). Returns all bird groups (e.g., Waterfowl, "
"Raptors, Owls, Hummingbirds, Woodpeckers, Sparrows) with their taxonomic "
"order bounds. Two grouping systems are available: 'merlin' (simplified "
"groups used in the Merlin Bird ID app, ~30 groups) and 'ebird' (full "
"eBird taxonomy groups, ~217 groups). Each group has a name, display "
"order, and taxon order bounds that map to species in the full taxonomy. "
"Useful for categorizing species into familiar bird groups. Can be "
"localized to different languages. No API key required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ebird_taxonomy_tools.rst:34
#: ../../tools/ebird_taxonomy_tools.rst:68 4b737302dbe34bbd855e6ef1a8241df7
#: ff93f36d114c4516a556b7051b6cec85
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ebird_taxonomy_tools.rst:36 2f62de17f6164bd4949ab54d06c1459b
msgid ""
"``speciesGrouping`` (string) (required) Grouping system to use. 'merlin' "
"returns ~30 simplified groups used in the Merlin Bird ID app (Waterfowl, "
"Hawks/Eagles, Owls, Hummingbirds, etc.). 'ebird' returns ~217 detailed "
"taxonomic groups (Ostriches, Kiwis, Ducks/Geese/Swans, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ebird_taxonomy_tools.rst:39 ae4311719e064cfbaf5037390a58ad9a
msgid ""
"``groupNameLocale`` (string, null) (optional) Language code for group "
"names (e.g., 'en' for English, 'es' for Spanish, 'fr' for French, 'de' "
"for German). Defaults to 'en'."
msgstr ""

